    <p class="eyebrow">Join</p>
    <h1 data-split data-split-delay="120">How to join ARIES</h1>
    <p class="lede">Membership is earned through contribution, not titles or
    conventional credentials. New members start in a small working group where
    skills, experience, and commitment are assessed on real work.</p>
  </div>
