<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">Eligibility</p>
    <h2 class="section-title u-mb-28" data-reveal="up">Who can apply</h2>
    <div class="criteria-grid" data-reveal-group="up">
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Aged between 15 and 30, in accordance with legal requirements</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> A Bangladeshi citizen</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Proficient in both English and Bangla</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Polite and formal, with vulgarity entirely absent from conduct</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Able to maintain good manners, professionalism, and cultural etiquette</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title u-mb-8" data-reveal="up">From new member to research leader</h2>
    <p class="section-lede u-mb-32">Every new member and
    associate is placed into a Sub Team &mdash; a small, goal-oriented group of about
    five people with a clear objective and deadline &mdash; to build real experience
    while their skills and commitment are assessed.</p>
    <div class="step-list" data-reveal-group="up">
      <div class="step-item">
        <p class="s-num">01</p>
        <div><h3>Join a Sub Team</h3>
        <p>Placed alongside roughly four peers under an Adjudicator (director) and one
        or two Vindicators (managers), as an Aide carrying out assigned tasks.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-item">
        <p class="s-num">02</p>
        <div><h3>Build a track record</h3>
        <p>Contribution is tracked transparently through a credit system tied to task
        completion, roles, and participation &mdash; visible to the whole organisation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-item">
        <p class="s-num">03</p>
        <div><h3>Train through Programs</h3>
        <p>Short, structured courses &mdash; video lessons, classes, assignments, and
        exams &mdash; prepare members for executive roles and recognise Program Graduates.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-item">
        <p class="s-num">04</p>
        <div><h3>Grow into leadership</h3>
        <p>Consistent contribution opens the way to executive and director roles, decided
        through transparent, merit-based governance rather than seniority or age.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">The research track</p>
    <h2 class="section-title u-mb-8" data-reveal="up">Fellowship &amp; Training Program</h2>
    <p class="section-lede u-mb-28">Alongside the general Sub
    Team path, ARIES runs a practical entry point into the Amaze R&amp;D team specifically.
    Fellows contribute to real research tasks &mdash; the pilot survey now in development
    is a live example &mdash; and are assigned into the research team structure based on
    their performance and engagement.</p>
    <div class="criteria-grid" data-reveal-group="up">
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Work on live tasks: survey design, data collection, and analysis</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Performance-based placement into the research team structure</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> A direct route toward roles like Data Analyst, Methodologist, or Ethics Officer</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


